BEEPER SOFTWARE (NOT REDISTRIBUTED)

This repository contains no Beeper software and no copy of Beeper's documentation or API specification.
server/Dockerfile downloads the official beeper-server build (proprietary software of Automattic Inc.)
from Beeper's servers, pinned by version and SHA-256 checksum, when you build the image yourself; you use
it under Beeper's own terms.

beeper-server itself bundles third-party open-source components, including Matrix bridges
licensed under the GNU AGPL-3.0, which Beeper distributes under its own license arrangements.
klatchly does not include, link to, or modify any of them: it only talks to the Beeper Desktop
API over HTTP. Do not redistribute images or archives that contain beeper-server.

The Beeper
Desktop API is documented by Beeper at https://developers.beeper.com/desktop-api/ ; its client library
@beeper/desktop-api is MIT-licensed.

