OPTIONAL INTEGRATIONS

The optional transcribe package sends a voice note, when a user taps Transcribe under it, to the speech-to-text
provider configured for it: NVIDIA's hosted Riva models (build.nvidia.com, under NVIDIA's own terms) or a server
with the OpenAI transcription API. None of their software is included here.

The optional agents and hermes packages, when present in this tree, connect to Hermes Agent, a separate
third-party project distributed under its own license; it is not included here.
